{
  "decision": "D395/D396/D404 (owner 2026-11-24): most PRs are reviewed by the GitHub GLM reviewer and its exact-head verdict counts; only IMPORTANT PRs need a Codex (GPT) lane verdict. A PR is IMPORTANT when its path tier is 2, it carries a label below, it touches maxFiles or more files, or ANY touched non-test path matches ANY area pattern (one important path makes the whole PR important; test files, rules.mjs TEST_RE, never match an area). Patterns are case-insensitive and use only syntax JavaScript and Python read alike. The coordinator (decide.py review_class) reads this same file from main.",
